//@version=6
strategy("INT28 c3 explicit exit pair and a same-bar same-id add", overlay=true, initial_capital=1000000, default_qty_type=strategy.fixed, default_qty_value=1, pyramiding=2)

// INT28 composition witness: W3-ENG-EXIT-ALLOC rule A (exits reserve an
// entry's quantity in the order they were created) and W8E-EXITS C1 (the
// KI-62 cover of a same-bar pyramid add stands only behind the leg's
// reduction of an older lot of its own id). The shape of tape
// ki62_same_id_cover/t3-same-id-add-cover (BINANCE:ETHUSDT.P 15): A (1) at
// 11:30 with two exits for it, AX1 (qty=1, target 1869.55) created first and
// AX2 (qty=1, a nearer target 1868.00) after it; a second A (1) at 12:00, on
// whose fill bar both targets are reached. A cleanup closes everything at
// 13:30.
T(h, m) => timestamp("UTC", 2025, 4, 1, h, m)
if time == T(11, 30)
    strategy.entry("A", strategy.long, qty=1)
    strategy.exit("AX1", from_entry="A", qty=1, limit=1869.55, stop=1800.0)
    strategy.exit("AX2", from_entry="A", qty=1, limit=1868.0, stop=1800.0)
if time == T(12, 0)
    strategy.entry("A", strategy.long, qty=1)
if time == T(13, 30)
    strategy.close_all()
